Ⓜ️ Meta unveils Muse Charm, a Tamagotchi-style AI device that puts a personal AI agent on your keychain.

The palm-sized 5G gadget lets users talk directly to Meta’s Muse AI agent without a phone, computer or glasses. Zuckerberg calls it a “joyful little device.” Meta plans to ship it in December, just in time for the holidays.

